---
/**
 * About — bio + contact.
 *
 * Bio is hand-authored. The full work history lives on LinkedIn (linked
 * below); this page is the short version for visitors who want the gist
 * before clicking out.
 *
 * Tagline + name: see `~/lib/site-meta` for the single source of truth.
 */
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_TAGLINE } from "~/lib/site-meta";
---
<BaseLayout
  title={SITE_NAME}
  description={`${SITE_NAME} — ${SITE_TAGLINE}. Generalist, problem solver, builder of small useful things.`}
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <article class="about prose">
    <header class="about-header">
      <p class="about-eyebrow">about</p>
      <h1>{SITE_NAME}</h1>
      <p class="about-tag">{SITE_TAGLINE}.</p>
    </header>
    <p>
      I've been shipping software since 2010 — most of it as a consultant,
      embedded with product and platform teams to untangle systems and turn
      vague problems into working code. My background is broad (deepest in
      the .NET ecosystem, generalist everywhere else), and the focus now is
      AI engineering: agentic workflows, model integrations, and the small
      developer tools that make those workflows sharper.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm drawn to novel problems — the kind that don't have a tidy answer
      waiting on the first page of search results. A few of the things I've
      built around that are on the <a href="/work/">work</a> page.
    </p>
    <p>
      For the long version — work history, recommendations, what I'm
      currently up to — see my
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/htxryan/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="me noreferrer"
      >LinkedIn profile</a>. Code lives on
      <a
        href="https://github.com/htxryan"
        target="_blank"
        rel="me noreferrer"
      >GitHub</a>; shorter thoughts on
      <a
        href="https://twitter.com/htxryan"
        target="_blank"
        rel="me noreferrer"
      >Twitter</a>. Reach me directly at
      <a href="mailto:contact@redhale.com">contact@redhale.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-header {
    border-bottom: var(--rule-hairline) solid var(--rule-color);
    padding-bottom: calc(var(--space-unit));
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--space-unit) * 2);
  }
  .about-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 calc(var(--space-unit) * 0.5);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .about h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw + 0.5rem, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .about-tag {
    margin: calc(var(--space-unit) * 0.75) 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
